{"t":"EIX","n":"Edison International","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":62.42,"chg":0.18,"chgPct":0.00289,"prev":62.24,"dayH":62.95,"dayL":61.48,"w52H":81.62,"w52L":51.1,"vol":3063291,"avgVol":2851060,"mcap":24018417664,"pe":6.63,"fpe":9.61,"eps":9.41,"feps":6.5,"pb":1.35,"div":3.51,"divY":0.0562,"beta":0.55,"short":16500537,"shortPct":0.0562,"shortRatio":3.5,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Utilities","sKo":"유용","i":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","iKo":"유틸리티 - 규제 전기","city":"Rosemead","emp":13725,"web":"https://www.edison.com","sum":"Edison International, through its subsidiaries, engages in the generation and distribution of electric power. The company supplies and delivers through its electrical infrastructure to an approximately 50,000 square-mile area of southern, central, and coastal California. It serves residential, commercial, industrial, public authorities, agricultural, street lighting, and other sectors. The company's distribution network consists of approximately 13,000 circuit-miles of lines ranging from 55 kV to 500 kV and approximately 80 transmission substations; and approximately 38,000 circuit-miles of overhead lines, approximately 32,000 circuit-miles of underground lines, and approximately 730 distribution substations. Edison International was founded in 1886 and is based in Rosemead, California.","sumKo":"Edison International은 자회사를 통해 전력 생산 및 유통에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 전기 인프라를 통해 캘리포니아 남부, 중부 및 해안의 약 50,000평방마일에 달하는 지역에 공급하고 배송합니다. 주거, 상업, 산업, 공공 기관, 농업, 가로등 및 기타 분야에 서비스를 제공합니다. 회사의 배전 네트워크는 55kV에서 500kV 범위의 약 13,000 회로 마일과 약 80개의 변전소로 구성됩니다. 가공선은 약 38,000 회로 마일, 지하철 노선은 약 32,000 회로 마일, 배전 변전소는 약 730개입니다. Edison International은 1886년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 로즈미드에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":17220000000,"ni":612000000},{"y":2023,"rev":16338000000,"ni":1197000000},{"y":2024,"rev":17599000000,"ni":1284000000},{"y":2025,"rev":19317000000,"ni":4459000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":5213000000,"ni":1848000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":4